flowchart TD
  Page[Dashboard: pageAccount UUID] --> Uploader[Один VideoUploader]
  Uploader --> Identity[upload-file-identity: noble full SHA]
  Uploader --> Resume[upload-resume: strict Zod / typed storage outcomes]
